OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after traffic warden
OL,4,Aattacked on city road
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 70-year-old man has been arrested
OL,7,Fafter a traffic warden was attacked in
OL,8,FHereford city centre - with the victim
OL,9,Fgoing to hospital with severe bruising.
OL,11,FThe enforcement officer was knocked
OL,12,Fover and "kicked multiple times while
OL,13,Fon the ground", before a member of the
OL,14,Fpublic intervened, Herefordshire
OL,15,FCouncil said.
OL,17,FCouncillor Barry Durkin, cabinet member
OL,18,Ffor roads, said: "There can be no
OL,19,Fexcuse for attacking someone who is
OL,20,Fsimply doing their job."
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
