OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after traffic warden
OL,4,Aattacked on city road
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pensioner who had been arrested had
OL,7,Fbeen released on bail in connection
OL,8,Fwith the incident while enquiries
OL,9,Fcontinued, West Mercia Police said.
